{"agent_id":"pp3g-FrFi-phase-1-pre-positioned-auditor-in-flight-divergence","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-08-08T23:52:57.498143149Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"42152b02-b4b8-4d94-bc49-5f08aef7614f","comment_uuid":"63f4325f-f649-467f-bcf4-76cfc4151cbf","author":"pp3g-FrFi-phase-1-pre-positioned-auditor-in-flight-divergence","content":"Plan (Phase-1 pre-positioned AUDITOR, read-only, in-flight divergence verifier for #306):\n\nSCOPE: I am the in-flight monitor dispatched alongside Builder pp3g-bv03, NOT a post-hoc final auditor. Phase 2 is a separate later dispatch. I flag; I do not fix, dispatch, or write.\n\nBASELINE ESTABLISHED (pre-Builder):\n- #295 catalog-scale corpus committed at 00eda4b3 (567 files, +20969) on branch feature/pp3g-VAPd-validation-task-evidence-only-measurement-not-a-9948. Not merged to main.\n- #306 settle task has three parts: (1) versions + calling_mode + persistence fields on Test 1/Test 2 per-run JSONs via RE-RUN (not hand-edit); (2) committed owner-death lifecycle log + producing script; (3) three systemic findings captured into docs/research/Identifier-First Tool Calling.md and/or epic #212.\n\nTRIGGER SET (I act only when one fires): (T1) position/heartbeat staleness >~2x the ~10-15min cadence, or no heartbeat while .kickoff-status=RUNNING; (T2) position-vs-artifact mismatch (claim of done unsupported by artifact/commit/log); (T3) reviewer disagreement; (T4) Orchestrator-explicit request.\n\nVERIFICATION METHOD (independent re-derivation, not watching):\n- V1 RE-RUN AUTHENTICITY: enumerate every Test1/Test2 per-run JSON; assert presence of versions + calling_mode + persistence on ALL of them; check timestamps are FRESH relative to the 00eda4b3 baseline (a hand-edit leaves the old run timestamp intact while adding fields — that is the specific failure mode to catch); assert measurement INVARIANCE (backend_spawn_count=0 across all N; Test 2 resident-after 0/0 both conditions) so the re-run settled evidence completeness without changing the outcome.\n- V2 OWNER-DEATH LOG: git log + file presence for both the lifecycle log AND the script that produced it; log must show parent exit, surviving orphan PIDs in ep_poll, TERM/KILL signal, final zero snapshot. Re-derivability is the criterion, not narrative.\n- V3 UMBRELLA CAPTURE: three findings present with version tags; git diff scope check that no other umbrella content was disturbed (focused insertion, not rewrite).\n\nEach check bounded ~5-10 min. I re-derive from artifacts via git (cross-worktree FS access is blocked; same object store so git show/diff works).\n\nLESSONS APPLIED: PVi7 (no absence call without confirming liveness via lock/positions/artifacts first); WZSE (artifact evidence leads position comments by minutes — I will not raise staleness while artifacts are advancing); fast-completion (a wrong-but-fast builder is only caught by independent re-derivation).\n\nCURRENT STATE: no feature branch matching Builder pp3g-bv03 exists yet; #306 lock is currently held by pp3g-VAPd (the #295 producer that filed #306), not by bv03. Builder appears not yet started or not yet branched. Per PVi7 I make NO absence call on this — establishing liveness evidence next.","created_at":"2026-08-08T23:52:57.487077504Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:6ZPwTCZQHAb9Qax0xz1itWQ6xCXo1ObYVllketlOttI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgCxhkcS34GTA3SE3Wh3eOxZFJgHrcgCJkQgM14YK6bbgAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAk4/pVoX35viVGxsqUggOkM6ObbQjMZZUJHzpVmUhow9cOPBq9FG82FB7kFykd5olWgRJiZnltN3X30SHZQrwAA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:6ZPwTCZQHAb9Qax0xz1itWQ6xCXo1ObYVllketlOttI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgCxhkcS34GTA3SE3Wh3eOxZFJgHrcgCJkQgM14YK6bbgAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNCoEWwjgXkkN2B/Br0Kljz1iZiB3j9KLAHqQMvsEC/KrM0ghVWIBdQC9A5AhqucYH4L8KrJ+mtxQImrIJUuygE="}
